{"id":"d2364757335c3ba6","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion.md","title":"对数空间的有限配置给出多项式时间判定","display":"thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion — 对数空间的有限配置给出多项式时间判定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion","aliases":["73-thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion"],"display":"thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion — 对数空间的有限配置给出多项式时间判定","depends_on":["[[73-df-logarithmic-space-classes]]","[[73-df-binary-p]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§12.4 and §13.5, pp. 300–302, 347–349; scans 308–310, 355–357; local configuration-count proof","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion — 对数空间的有限配置给出多项式时间判定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5ab86dd38fd2810\" href=\"?note=c5ab86dd38fd2810\" title=\"73-df-logarithmic-space-classes\">73-df-logarithmic-space-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§12.4 and §13.5, pp. 300–302, 347–349; scans 308–310, 355–357; local configuration-count proof"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LOGSPACE},\\mathsf{NL}\">\\(\\mathsf{LOGSPACE},\\mathsf{NL}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c5ab86dd38fd2810\" href=\"?note=c5ab86dd38fd2810\" title=\"73-df-logarithmic-space-classes\">73-df-logarithmic-space-classes</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a>。输入读头必须遵守其工作空间模型的有界约定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nl\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}inclusion}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathsf P\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nl\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}inclusion}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathsf P\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定机器的 O(log n) 工作格、有限状态、工作头位置及 n+2 种输入头位置只给出多项式个配置。确定性枚举配置图并做可达性搜索即可判定是否存在接受分支；枚举固定机器的一条边也只需多项式时间。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-logarithmic-space-classes","status":"resolved","id":"c5ab86dd38fd2810","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-logarithmic-space-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-logarithmic-space-classes","status":"resolved","id":"c5ab86dd38fd2810","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{LOGSPACE},\\mathsf{NL}$ 见 [[73-df-logarithmic-space-classes]]，$\\mathsf P$ 见 [[73-df-binary-p]]。输入读头必须遵守其工作空间模型的有界约定。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{LOGSPACE},\\mathsf{NL}$ 见 [[73-df-logarithmic-space-classes]]，$\\mathsf P$ 见 [[73-df-binary-p]]。输入读头必须遵守其工作空间模型的有界约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{LOGSPACE},\\mathsf{NL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nl\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}inclusion}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NL}\\subseteq\\mathsf P","display":true}],"bytes":1695,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-nl-polynomial-time-inclusion|对数空间的有限配置给出多项式时间判定]]"}],"outgoing":["c5ab86dd38fd2810","5a23e63a72e2443c"]}